### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8084
@dockerUrl = http://payment-service:8084
@contentType = application/json

### ─── READ ALL PAYMENTS ───
### Returns 4 seeded payments (2 completed, 1 pending, 1 failed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── READ PAYMENT BY ID ───
### Payment 1: order 1, $1299.99, COMPLETED, CREDIT_CARD
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── READ PAYMENT BY ORDER ID ───
### Lookup payment for order 2 ($89.97, PAYPAL, COMPLETED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/order/2
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── READ PAYMENT BY ORDER ID (pending) ───
### Order 3 payment is still PENDING
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/order/3
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── PROCESS NEW PAYMENT ───
### Simulate successful payment for a new order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "orderId": 5,
  "amount": 59.99,
  "method": "CREDIT_CARD"
}

### ─── PROCESS NEW PAYMENT (PAYPAL) ───
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "orderId": 6,
  "amount": 149.99,
  "method": "PAYPAL"
}

### ─── PROCESS NEW PAYMENT (DEBIT_CARD) ───
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "orderId": 7,
  "amount": 12.50,
  "method": "DEBIT_CARD"
}

### ─── MCP TOOL DISCOVERY (SSE) ───
GET {{baseUrl}}/mcp/sse
Accept: text/event-stream

### ─── HEALTH CHECK ───
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: {{contentType}}